-     *
-     * You can declare a test as failing, so that Playwright ensures it actually fails.
-     *
-     * ```js
-     * import { test, expect } from '@playwright/test';
-     *
-     * test.fail('not yet ready', async ({ page }) => {
-     *   // ...
-     * });
