- *
- * Alternatively, with [test.use(options)](https://playwright.dev/docs/api/class-test#test-use) you can override some
- * options for a file.
- *
- * ```js
- * // example.spec.ts
- * import { test, expect } from '@playwright/test';
- *
- * // Run tests in this file with portrait-like viewport.
